  "details": "Depending on the use case, there are instances where both contacts and physbones are used in ways where the components only need to run locally. Since a hard limit was introduced a while back to limit all avatar dynamics components to 255 each, I think it would be reasonable to allow for any dynamics components marked as local only to not contribute to performance stats or the component hard limit. Beyond the usual use cases these components have, they're also often used for building sensors that use synchronized parameters and therefore do not need to run remotely. This includes physbone components as they're great for tracking velocity data; an example of this would be the Weapon Slash prefab provided by VRLabs: https://github.com/VRLabs/Weapon-Slash",
